<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila stock market closed for Independence Day.</title>
<headline>Manila stock market closed for Independence Day.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine equities market is closed on Thursday as the nation marks its 99th Independence Day.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the main index climbed 12.63 points or 0.46 percent to 2,787.74 amid light trading.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
